# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# AegisHealth-KG frontend configuration
#
# Copy to `.env.local` and adjust. All variables are optional.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Data source: "mock" (fictional demonstration data, no network) or "live".
# The active source is always displayed in the top bar and can be switched at
# runtime without a rebuild.
VITE_DATA_SOURCE=mock

# Base URL of the FastAPI backend.
#
# Leave EMPTY for development: requests go to the relative `/api` path, which
# Vite proxies to http://localhost:8000 (see vite.config.ts). This avoids
# needing CORS, which the FastAPI app does not configure.
#
# Set an absolute URL only when serving the built assets from a different origin
# than the API — and add CORSMiddleware to src/aegis/api/main.py first.
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8000